  "title": "Schuylkill County Historical Society Announces Fall Schedule of Haunted Tours, Programs and Workshops",
  "excerpt": "The Schuylkill County Historical Society announced fall events featuring haunted tours, history programs and Pysanky egg workshops.",
  "lang": "en",
  "words": 571,
  "image": {
    "width": 800,
    "height": 420,
    "source": "https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhcZThx2k_nXljvFPqRh9TQGUuoZ-2RY3cJKJrFq-mjAhfFDeOF7wIA14m10uaJR45ZUSUCCiDITsu2qWangy0wWN3RHn3e5doOvglqcDPdAYbTCSIbVy1OFf1Efmc_hfOhzfHG4o1ysHyfIgWO1kAOFyc3pWdRsh2kAJMUXgvaEO76omX8xGdWOIOr3g/w1200-h630-p-k-no-nu/SchuylkillCountyHistoricalSociety.png"
  },
  "content": "<figure>\n  <a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhcZThx2k_nXljvFPqRh9TQGUuoZ-2RY3cJKJrFq-mjAhfFDeOF7wIA14m10uaJR45ZUSUCCiDITsu2qWangy0wWN3RHn3e5doOvglqcDPdAYbTCSIbVy1OFf1Efmc_hfOhzfHG4o1ysHyfIgWO1kAOFyc3pWdRsh2kAJMUXgvaEO76omX8xGdWOIOr3g/s1200/SchuylkillCountyHistoricalSociety.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhcZThx2k_nXljvFPqRh9TQGUuoZ-2RY3cJKJrFq-mjAhfFDeOF7wIA14m10uaJR45ZUSUCCiDITsu2qWangy0wWN3RHn3e5doOvglqcDPdAYbTCSIbVy1OFf1Efmc_hfOhzfHG4o1ysHyfIgWO1kAOFyc3pWdRsh2kAJMUXgvaEO76omX8xGdWOIOr3g/w640-h336/SchuylkillCountyHistoricalSociety.png\" alt=\"Schuylkill County Historical Society fall 2026 events\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"640\" height=\"336\" />\n  </a>\n</figure>\n\n<p>The Schuylkill County Historical Society has announced a fall schedule featuring paranormal investigations, haunted history tours, local history programs and holiday-themed Pysanky egg workshops.</p>\n\n\n\n\n  <h2>Pottsville After Dark: Paranormal Investigation</h2>\n\n  <figure>\n    <a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgxuSXamG1DMbXG6C_rg4ZXRjGrCJJz9H9x4qi-AwcJm6w68pKdb9kaKQnmAH4_PSW2zvctwWyg9rWrrXR9-cfK9DxPPStnq3iFV4BODdxXEP3u_GaCvXt4RJyDYvT35cg2UqB2OebLlHq3usvD6zxCUCQdOg8xRzUNbRobB3HH3ik0Jyga-nQ4vVqbpd7A/s1500/Paranormal%20Investigation.jpg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">\n      <img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgxuSXamG1DMbXG6C_rg4ZXRjGrCJJz9H9x4qi-AwcJm6w68pKdb9kaKQnmAH4_PSW2zvctwWyg9rWrrXR9-cfK9DxPPStnq3iFV4BODdxXEP3u_GaCvXt4RJyDYvT35cg2UqB2OebLlHq3usvD6zxCUCQdOg8xRzUNbRobB3HH3ik0Jyga-nQ4vVqbpd7A/w640-h384/Paranormal%20Investigation.jpg\" alt=\"Pottsville After Dark paranormal investigation at the Schuylkill County Historical Society\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"640\" height=\"384\" />\n    </a>\n  </figure>\n\n  <p>The Pottsville After Dark Series will bring guests inside the historic halls of the Schuylkill County Historical Society for an immersive paranormal investigation at <time datetime=\"2026-10-02T19:00\">7 p.m. Friday, October 2</time>.</p>\n  <p>The evening will begin with an introduction to the building’s history and the investigative equipment participants will use. After learning the basics of paranormal investigation, guests will divide into smaller groups to explore the building.</p>\n  <p><strong>Admission:</strong> $65. Registration is required.</p>\n\n\n\n  <h2>Haunted History Walking Tours of Downtown Pottsville</h2>\n\n  <figure>\n    <a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjuFNUqnPOm_HVLpdrHBLZLNltR2wUrcRFA3lSsrMHuJ-eGiZMDQ22Vw3hdu8s_irBBevraYd-meuf8qSd6iVmrSdqyRgGI7WRZuqn8NvKxjHSORhRL__9D-VGhvx_ibP7pLRnc1DpESt_5DlMqRl_cPRoPDijw3agJFj7LMsU-RDAdc-8xDU-hY7inCpdn/s1920/Haunted%20History%20Tour%20Fb%20Event%20Cover%20(1).png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">\n      <img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjuFNUqnPOm_HVLpdrHBLZLNltR2wUrcRFA3lSsrMHuJ-eGiZMDQ22Vw3hdu8s_irBBevraYd-meuf8qSd6iVmrSdqyRgGI7WRZuqn8NvKxjHSORhRL__9D-VGhvx_ibP7pLRnc1DpESt_5DlMqRl_cPRoPDijw3agJFj7LMsU-RDAdc-8xDU-hY7inCpdn/w640-h360/Haunted%20History%20Tour%20Fb%20Event%20Cover%20(1).png\" alt=\"Haunted History Walking Tours of downtown Pottsville\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" />\n    </a>\n  </figure>\n\n  <p>The Society will lead Haunted History Tours through downtown Pottsville at <time datetime=\"2026-10-10T19:30\">7:30 p.m. Saturday, October 10</time>, and again at <time datetime=\"2026-10-24T19:30\">7:30 p.m. Saturday, October 24</time>.</p>\n  <p>The walking tours will explore Pottsville’s eerie past through local legends, reported ghostly encounters and stories of spectral sightings, all set against the city’s history.</p>\n  <p><strong>Admission:</strong> $10 for Society members and $15 for the general public. Registration is required.</p>\n\n\n\n  <h2>Fate and Family: A Story of Cressona and the Civil War</h2>\n\n  <figure>\n    <a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEikZbh6y_jGx3fqQI44sA_l5EPxJK_JSYk6bAsCB_wXJxXfvtm-TCxB1MWDyD-656qdXBI_SekskSmpAQP2rhD4pLHg2sPpkxKI2enEJPt8O8q7lls6cQcZbJNQDTlReoUEye4EleyLsW2A-FFsiPXbRrk2r1EpS646DLOzZO_uZDRUhgv-ssWvPOUlKWlb/s1920/Fate%20and%20Family%20FB%20Event%20Cover.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">\n      <img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEikZbh6y_jGx3fqQI44sA_l5EPxJK_JSYk6bAsCB_wXJxXfvtm-TCxB1MWDyD-656qdXBI_SekskSmpAQP2rhD4pLHg2sPpkxKI2enEJPt8O8q7lls6cQcZbJNQDTlReoUEye4EleyLsW2A-FFsiPXbRrk2r1EpS646DLOzZO_uZDRUhgv-ssWvPOUlKWlb/w640-h360/Fate%20and%20Family%20FB%20Event%20Cover.png\" alt=\"Fate and Family program about Cressona and the Civil War\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" />\n    </a>\n  </figure>\n\n  <p>Orwigsburg resident Robert McCloy will discuss the experiences of his ancestors from Schuylkill County and Virginia during and after the Civil War at <time datetime=\"2026-10-15T18:30\">6:30 p.m. Thursday, October 15</time>.</p>\n  <p>The program will explore the remarkable circumstances that eventually brought the two sides of his family together.</p>\n  <p><strong>Admission:</strong> Free for Society members and $5 for nonmembers.</p>\n\n\n\n  <h2>Haunted History Tour of Charles Baber Cemetery</h2>\n\n  <figure>\n    <a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgv4ApYeA3a9vOTaoH5FcPPS0coNUAxW7d0IEWhV5o_-V6HjZbsqeI9vr6B4PoLdfB94f9XL60-6_3d_OhjAq5la52wclpDQqLffuPyHiXXhEgvH6CzWAmibwvAagtXYjt6kxzvjzLpJc7qwf3guAVdY4hQqiH_f8apBYfwQLPJrQF6fmeBjvtd8Y8TxB4c/s1920/Haunted%20History%20Tour-%20Charles%20Baber%20Fb%20Event%20Cover%20(2).png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">\n      <img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgv4ApYeA3a9vOTaoH5FcPPS0coNUAxW7d0IEWhV5o_-V6HjZbsqeI9vr6B4PoLdfB94f9XL60-6_3d_OhjAq5la52wclpDQqLffuPyHiXXhEgvH6CzWAmibwvAagtXYjt6kxzvjzLpJc7qwf3guAVdY4hQqiH_f8apBYfwQLPJrQF6fmeBjvtd8Y8TxB4c/w640-h360/Haunted%20History%20Tour-%20Charles%20Baber%20Fb%20Event%20Cover%20(2).png\" alt=\"Haunted History Tour of Charles Baber Cemetery in Pottsville\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" />\n    </a>\n  </figure>\n\n  <p>The Society will host a haunted history walking tour through Charles Baber Cemetery at <time datetime=\"2026-10-17T18:30\">6:30 p.m. Saturday, October 17</time>.</p>\n  <p>Participants will walk among the resting places of notable figures from Schuylkill County’s past while hearing their stories told with a chilling historical twist.</p>\n  <p>The tour will meet at the cemetery, located at <strong>1400 W. Market St., Pottsville</strong>.</p>\n  <p><strong>Admission:</strong> $10 for Society members and $15 for the general public. Registration is required.</p>\n\n\n\n  <h2>The Headless Ghosts of Schuylkill County</h2>\n\n  <figure>\n    <a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEigDI7_4FP2NUvo10N2lblCf3oxTbGYLlAWUW1DBtrtIcsdbNAVkaoYp6-cv7Ht2ab9SfWGzK-angbuJRZKsPSjVsnWzmPDCsztuGqP807hcnQr6EF94OembW39qrE_chy82AubqpKq1A2U_4h161bF0La84WSgKK_tznKTNM_mugfGmrjwcBqSkbfGnZ_2/s1920/Headless%20Ghosts%20FB%20Event%20Cover.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">\n      <img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEigDI7_4FP2NUvo10N2lblCf3oxTbGYLlAWUW1DBtrtIcsdbNAVkaoYp6-cv7Ht2ab9SfWGzK-angbuJRZKsPSjVsnWzmPDCsztuGqP807hcnQr6EF94OembW39qrE_chy82AubqpKq1A2U_4h161bF0La84WSgKK_tznKTNM_mugfGmrjwcBqSkbfGnZ_2/w640-h360/Headless%20Ghosts%20FB%20Event%20Cover.png\" alt=\"The Headless Ghosts of Schuylkill County program\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" />\n    </a>\n  </figure>\n\n  <p>Local author Richard Bigg will share tales of headless miners, witchcraft, strange coincidences and tragic railroad accidents from Pennsylvania and New York at <time datetime=\"2026-10-22T18:30\">6:30 p.m. Thursday, October 22</time>.</p>\n  <p>The Halloween-season program will be held at the Historical Society.</p>\n  <p><strong>Admission:</strong> Free for Society members and $5 for the general public.</p>\n\n\n\n  <h2>America 250: Olde Thyme Toys</h2>\n\n  <figure>\n    <a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg5SSB9DMyEsERKToNjZ7Ssq60ARjGhSkHtR_0KvKwK5rbnht5m_dYv17D5vodGDiOI_5_pKF1y16UUxQRD_TkOIUAkh9n1S06AVLHI2-bsqxBOtFMskLSVKHAig1VpzCaomPLtOr3GC455fD8KhfbrID5OUcYXwB0G-pZYoNGRK6WBtvApc3P2-uV09oMB/s1920/Old%20Tyme%20Toys%20FB%20Event%20Cover.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">\n      <img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg5SSB9DMyEsERKToNjZ7Ssq60ARjGhSkHtR_0KvKwK5rbnht5m_dYv17D5vodGDiOI_5_pKF1y16UUxQRD_TkOIUAkh9n1S06AVLHI2-bsqxBOtFMskLSVKHAig1VpzCaomPLtOr3GC455fD8KhfbrID5OUcYXwB0G-pZYoNGRK6WBtvApc3P2-uV09oMB/w640-h360/Old%20Tyme%20Toys%20FB%20Event%20Cover.png\" alt=\"America 250 Olde Thyme Toys program\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" />\n    </a>\n  </figure>\n\n  <p>Local environmental educator and Society board member “Porcupine” Pat McKinney will display his personal collection of pioneer and folk toys and discuss their history during a hands-on, all-ages program at <time datetime=\"2026-11-12T18:30\">6:30 p.m. Thursday, November 12</time>.</p>\n  <p><strong>Admission:</strong> Free for Society members and $5 for the general public.</p>\n\n\n\n  <h2>The History of Intellectual and Creative Property in Schuylkill County</h2>\n\n  <figure>\n    <a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjXYw88897MM_dRtBmyYRqWdn1KAEbQHWsufkO0XmHScFrU5jRQN4L9OmTdJYOWXapzQmiXNjMQdn6sKz-okYiNVR2m1ysKMqoD5zL_Wjy6DIacT78vWK-L18MdXHrD_tHYw3ufOTElFI_GqIFfCRbfhJv8WFMBq4csvs4r9rhkEQokwPYZTwn6Wk8ZG1sf/s1920/The%20History%20of%20IP%20FB%20Event%20Cover.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">\n      <img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjXYw88897MM_dRtBmyYRqWdn1KAEbQHWsufkO0XmHScFrU5jRQN4L9OmTdJYOWXapzQmiXNjMQdn6sKz-okYiNVR2m1ysKMqoD5zL_Wjy6DIacT78vWK-L18MdXHrD_tHYw3ufOTElFI_GqIFfCRbfhJv8WFMBq4csvs4r9rhkEQokwPYZTwn6Wk8ZG1sf/w640-h360/The%20History%20of%20IP%20FB%20Event%20Cover.png\" alt=\"History of Intellectual and Creative Property in Schuylkill County program\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" />\n    </a>\n  </figure>\n\n  <p>Society board member Dave Russek will present a program examining intellectual property that has helped shape Schuylkill County and the wider world at <time datetime=\"2026-11-19T18:30\">6:30 p.m. Thursday, November 19</time>.</p>\n  <p><strong>Admission:</strong> Free for Society members and $5 for the general public.</p>\n\n\n\n  <h2>Christmas-Themed Pysanky Egg Workshops</h2>\n\n  <figure>\n    <a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgQsmTpwpeneVlbyaQXrl9ns7Jar-Qp8oNY104rK4clsydUh-dCgfdSpAdJxWFJubn3E6zFkLT_wh9fdY3EILnC8w4LeIZ5GnwwJVL1VH0qb4bbBjDd4hDcYymU2eiZyRoNfCOksnxUCBf41aWZW_mSGgM0HLC0OLoHgjLbVefUAF8hLsM04pGehiBjW2Tf/s1920/Pysanky%20Egg%202026%20FB%20Event%20Cover.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">\n      <img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgQsmTpwpeneVlbyaQXrl9ns7Jar-Qp8oNY104rK4clsydUh-dCgfdSpAdJxWFJubn3E6zFkLT_wh9fdY3EILnC8w4LeIZ5GnwwJVL1VH0qb4bbBjDd4hDcYymU2eiZyRoNfCOksnxUCBf41aWZW_mSGgM0HLC0OLoHgjLbVefUAF8hLsM04pGehiBjW2Tf/w640-h360/Pysanky%20Egg%202026%20FB%20Event%20Cover.png\" alt=\"Christmas-themed Pysanky egg workshops at the Schuylkill County Historical Society\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" />\n    </a>\n  </figure>\n\n  <p>Renowned folk artist Georgine Postupak-Borchick will lead three hands-on, Christmas-themed Pysanky egg workshops at the Historical Society.</p>\n  <ul>\n    <li><strong><time datetime=\"2026-11-21T11:00\">Saturday, November 21, at 11 a.m.</time>:</strong> Cutout diorama Pysanky eggs</li>\n    <li><strong><time datetime=\"2026-11-28T11:00\">Saturday, November 28, at 11 a.m.</time>:</strong> Natural etching on brown eggs</li>\n    <li><strong><time datetime=\"2026-12-05T11:00\">Saturday, December 5, at 11 a.m.</time>:</strong> A mixture of modern and traditional Pysanky egg techniques</li>\n  </ul>\n  <p><strong>Admission:</strong> $30 for Society members and $35 for nonmembers for each workshop. Registration is required.</p>\n\n\n<h2>Location and Registration Information</h2>\n\n<p>Unless otherwise noted, programs will be held at the <strong>Schuylkill County Historical Society, 305 N. Centre St., Pottsville</strong>.</p>\n\n<p>For more information or to register, call <a>570-622-7540</a> or visit <a href=\"https://www.schuylkillhistory.org/events\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">schuylkillhistory.org/events</a>.</p>"
